    "text": "I hereby give notice, under sub-section (1) of section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition(amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intendsto acquire the following land/servitude which is required forconstruction of jungle training camp and armory for Sri LankaNavy.",
